                                  values: little, big]
  -b, --base <B>                  Sets the base used for the bytes. The possible options
                                  are binary, octal, decimal, and hexadecimal [default:
                                  hexadecimal]
      --terminal-width <N>        Sets the number of terminal columns to be displayed.
